    <string name="settings_safety">Safety and scope</string>
    <string name="settings_safety_body">JAC DRIVE is a monitoring and diagnostics companion. It reads standard OBD-II data only. It never controls steering or braking, never modifies ECU settings, never disables safety systems and never clears fault codes without your explicit confirmation.\n\nDo not interact with the phone while driving. Acceleration tests must only be performed in legal, controlled environments, never on public roads.</string>
